                  <msItem>
                     <title>Breviarium Sarisb.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">John Copynger, confessor general of Syon in
                        1537: see Aungier.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">The breviary evidently belonged to a fellow of
                        Magdalen Coll. (cf. Downside review nos. 3, 5).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">At May 5 is '[...] raynolde obitus', i. e.
                        Richard Reynoldes for whom see D.N.B. -- hanged May 4 1535.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">May 8 'Obitus E. Bryther'.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
